*
* Extracted Physical Parameters:
*   VTO          = 3.799964e+00  (Zero-bias threshold voltage)
*   KP           = 4.820300e-01  (Transconductance parameter)
*   THETA        = 2.609896e-02  (Mobility degradation coefficient)
*   U0           = 4.999131e+01  (Low-field surface mobility)
*   NFS          = 1.965024e+11  (Fast surface state density)
*   GAMMA        = 1.500000e+00  (Body effect coefficient)
*   PHI          = 6.499374e-01  (Surface potential 2*phi_p)
*   VMAX         = 2.000000e+07  (Carrier saturation velocity)
*   KAPPA        = 5.000000e-01  (Saturation field factor)
*   LAMBDA       = 4.988865e-04  (Channel length modulation)
*   R_JFET0      = 1.002588e-01  (JFET zero-bias resistance)
*   KAPPA_VT     = -5.994296e-03  (VTH temperature coefficient)
