.SUBCKT SiC_MOSFET_PINN D G S
* =========================================================================
* Pin Assignments:
*   D = Drain  (top contact)
*   G = Gate   (gate electrode)
*   S = Source (source contact)
* =========================================================================

* --- Source Resistance ---
RS S S_INT 1.0000e-02

* --- Channel MOSFET (SPICE Level-3) ---
M_CH D_JFET G S_INT S_INT NMOS_4HSIC L=1e-6 W=5.2e-6

* --- JFET Resistance (SiC vertical MOSFET) ---
J_JFET D_INT D_JFET G NJFET_4HSIC AREA=1
R_JFET_EXT D D_INT 1.0026e-01

* --- Nonlinear Capacitances ---
* Gate-Drain (Miller) capacitance: nonlinear charge model
* Inherited from previous work ¡ª validated against TCAD C-V simulation
CGD D G Q = (1.35e-10 * 1.01**(0.831) * 200**(0.1699)) / (7.06e35 * (1/(x + 0.505))**(0.1699))

* Drain-Source capacitance
CDS D S Q = 2**(0.48) / (9.6e14 * (1/(x + 0.5))**(0.48))

* Gate-Source capacitance (constant ¡ª validated by previous work)
CGS G S 5.86e-16

* =========================================================================
* SPICE Level-3 MOSFET Model Card
* =========================================================================
.MODEL NMOS_4HSIC NMOS (
+ LEVEL  = 3
+ VTO    = 3.8000       $ Zero-bias threshold voltage [V]
+ KP     = 4.8203e-01        $ Transconductance parameter [A/V^2]
+ THETA  = 2.6099e-02     $ Mobility degradation coefficient [1/V]
+ UO     = 49.99        $ Low-field surface mobility [cm^2/V-s]
+ NFS    = 1.9650e+11       $ Fast surface state density [cm^-2]
+ GAMMA  = 1.5000     $ Body effect coefficient [V^0.5]
+ PHI    = 0.6499       $ Surface potential 2*phi_p [V]
+ VMAX   = 2.0000e+07      $ Carrier saturation velocity [m/s]
+ KAPPA  = 0.5000     $ Saturation field factor [-]
+ LAMBDA = 4.9889e-04    $ Channel length modulation [1/V]
+ TOX    = 5.0000e-08       $ Gate oxide thickness [m]
+ NSUB   = 2.20e15         $ Substrate doping [cm^-3]
+ TPG    = 1               $ Polysilicon gate (N+ type)
+ IS     = 1.00e-30        $ Bulk junction saturation current [A]
+ JS     = 1.00e-12        $ Bulk junction saturation current density [A/m^2]
+ N      = 1.00            $ Emission coefficient
+ RS     = 0.00            $ Source ohmic resistance (external RS used)
+ RD     = 0.00            $ Drain ohmic resistance
+ LD     = 0.00            $ Lateral diffusion [m]
+ WD     = 0.00            $ Lateral diffusion width [m]
+ )

* =========================================================================
* NJFET Model Card (JFET region)
* =========================================================================
.MODEL NJFET_4HSIC NJF (
+ VTO    = -3.00           $ JFET pinch-off voltage [V]
+ BETA   = 0.50            $ JFET transconductance [A/V^2]
+ LAMBDA = 1.00e-3         $ JFET channel length modulation [1/V]
+ IS     = 1.00e-30        $ Gate junction saturation current
+ )

.ENDS SiC_MOSFET_PINN

* =========================================================================
* Temperature Dependence Model
* =========================================================================
* VTH(T)  = VTH(300K) + KAPPA_VT * (T - 300)
*   KAPPA_VT = -5.9943e-03 [V/K]
*
* MU(T)   = U0 * (T/300)^(-ALPHA_MU)
*   ALPHA_MU = 2.517
*
* For LTspice: Use .TEMP sweep or .STEP TEMP
* For ngspice: Use .TEMP statement
* Example: .TEMP 25 75 125 175
* =========================================================================


* =========================================================================
* Auto-generated Validation Testbench
* =========================================================================
* Run .DC sweep to verify output and transfer characteristics

* Instance of the SiC MOSFET model
XU1 D G 0 SiC_MOSFET_PINN

* DC voltage sources
VGS G 0 DC 10.0
VDS D 0 DC 100.0

* Output characteristic: ID vs VDS at multiple VGS
* .DC VDS 0 1200 10 VGS 5 15 2.5

* Transfer characteristic: ID vs VGS at fixed VDS
.DC VGS 0 20 0.1

* Analysis
.PROBE I(VDS)
.END
